<header><p class="st-kicker">emirate · Iberia</p><h1 class="st-title">Third Taifa of Murcia</h1><p class="st-meta">1228 CE – 1266 CE · capital Murcia</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">The realm of Ibn Hud, who briefly united al-Andalus against the Almohads, and of his heirs, who ended as Castilian vassals in Murcia.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>In 1228 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ibn-hud">Muhammad ibn Yusuf ibn Hud</a>, claiming descent from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/banu-hud">Hudids</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zaragoza">Zaragoza</a>, rose against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/almohad-caliphate">Almohads</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ricote-valley">Ricote</a> valley. He recognised the Abbasid <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">caliph</a>, took the title al-Mutawakkil, and within months most of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/al-andalus">al-Andalus</a>, including <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seville">Seville</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cordoba">Córdoba</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/granada">Granada</a>, accepted his rule.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ibn-hud">Ibn Hud's</a> popularity rested on rejecting <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/almohad-caliphate">Almohad</a> doctrine and promising relief from taxes, but his armies lost to León at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-alange">Alange</a> in 1230 and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cordoba">Córdoba</a> fell to <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/kingdom-of-castile">Castile</a> in 1236. He was murdered in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/almeria">Almería</a> in 1238, and his realm shrank to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/murcia">Murcia</a>. By the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-alcaraz">Treaty of Alcaraz</a> of 1243 Murcia became a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/protectorate">protectorate</a> of the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/crown-of-castile">Crown of Castile</a>.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mudejar-revolt-of-1264-1266">Mudéjar revolt</a> of 1264 drew a Castilian and Aragonese response: <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/james-i-of-aragon">James I of Aragon</a> took <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/murcia">Murcia</a> in 1266 for <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/kingdom-of-castile">Castile</a>, and the territory became the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/kingdom-of-murcia">Kingdom of Murcia</a>.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="emirate, 1228 CE – 1266 CE"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 82 V62 Q24 40 50 34 Q76 40 76 62 V82 Z"/><path d="M50 34 V24"/><path d="M53 13 A6 6 0 1 0 53 25 A4.5 4.5 0 1 1 53 13"/><path d="M38 82 V66 Q44 58 50 66 V82"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">emirate</p><p class="st-emblem-region">Iberia</p><div class="st-span" aria-hidden="true"><span class="st-span-bar" style="left:84.14%;width:1.20%"></span></div><div class="st-span-axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>3000 BCE</span><span>1 CE</span><span>2000</span></div></div><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>1228 CE – 1266 CE</dd><dt>Century</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/13th-century">13th century</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>emirate</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>feudal</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Murcia</dd><dt>Rulers</dt><dd>Muhammad ibn Hud al-Mutawakkil, Abu Bakr al-Wathiq</dd><dt>Religion</dt><dd>Sunni Islam</dd><dt>Language</dt><dd>Andalusi Arabic</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/spain">Spain</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Hudid Murcia, Kingdom of Murcia (Hudid)</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=1247&amp;focus=third-taifa-of-murcia" aria-label="Third Taifa of Murcia on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4652 812 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Third Taifa of Murcia lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-tie" d="M4972 1068L4794 1282M4972 1068L4885 950M4972 1068L4972 1068"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M4794 1282h0M4885 950h0M4972 1068h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" 